OL,3,GNEWSAParents deny causing death of
OL,4,Aone-year-old son
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother and father have denied causing
OL,7,Fthe death of their one-year-old son who
OL,8,Fwas found severely malnourished.
OL,10,FMaero Johnson, from St Helens,
OL,11,FMerseyside, died in hospital in August
OL,12,F2023.
OL,14,FAt Liverpool Crown Court, Adam Johnson,
OL,15,F26, and Kylie Smith, 25, of St Helens,
OL,16,Fpleaded not guilty to causing or
OL,17,Fallowing the death of a child between 5
OL,18,FJune and 24 August 2023.
OL,20,FA trial, expected to last four to six
OL,21,Fweeks, is due to begin on 9 April 2027.
